{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The\u00a0Joker's\u00a0Game",
    "steam_appid": 2983660,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/420c0ed0cc71cf4abf1717c7ab92725d.avif?t=1753931975\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into a deadly game fraught with perils</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Joker's Game&quot; will transport you to a mansion crafted by a mysterious organization, where everything operates under the brutal rule of &quot;survival of the fittest, annihilation of the weak.&quot; The game offers lethal, upgraded versions of classic childhood games: you must fight for survival across various challenges. Can you trust your companions here? Even your most trusted ally might strike you down from behind with a fatal blow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/2daa5f118e041f6cd12ab3adc6b9991c.poster.avif?t=1753931975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/2daa5f118e041f6cd12ab3adc6b9991c.webm?t=1753931975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/2daa5f118e041f6cd12ab3adc6b9991c.mp4?t=1753931975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Temptation-Filled Battle Royale Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Joker's Game</i>, you'll encounter many companions. Some offer genuine affection, while others harbor hidden agendas. Amidst this seductive journey, who will you choose as your most steadfast ally? Who will stand with you to claim the ultimate prize? It all depends entirely on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/71a87b6644f2ff741eb066163ed360eb.poster.avif?t=1753931975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/71a87b6644f2ff741eb066163ed360eb.webm?t=1753931975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/71a87b6644f2ff741eb066163ed360eb.mp4?t=1753931975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles and games combine to create an exhilarating experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Joker's Game&quot; is no mere orgy of violence\u2014every challenge is a test of wit and strategy! In &quot;Sugar Art Challenge,&quot; players must draw intricate patterns with chocolate sauce; in &quot;Maze Escape,&quot; players must decode visual illusions to find a way out. Additionally, the game incorporates multi-dimensional puzzle mechanics: voting strategy, using &quot;minority rule&quot; votes to eliminate rivals and leverage psychological warfare to manipulate situations; teamwork, sharing clues with temporary allies but watching for betrayals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/84ab3cc8e854314e6c859dc4a920e26b.poster.avif?t=1753931975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/84ab3cc8e854314e6c859dc4a920e26b.webm?t=1753931975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/84ab3cc8e854314e6c859dc4a920e26b.mp4?t=1753931975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Choice, Your Fate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > &quot;You think winning the prize will set you free? This is just the beginning of a much larger conspiracy...&quot; The game reveals the dark truth behind the amusement park through multi-threaded narratives: among the participants are debt-ridden gamblers, undercover police officers hiding their identities, and elites attempting to atone for their sins. As the plot unfolds, players will gradually uncover the true motives of the organizers - whether it's a wealthy tycoon's entertainment gambling, a front for human experiments, or a cruel metaphor for class society. Your choices will influence the branching outcomes of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/4077774209a5ee0e59c0c56945afde96.poster.avif?t=1753931975\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/4077774209a5ee0e59c0c56945afde96.webm?t=1753931975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/4077774209a5ee0e59c0c56945afde96.mp4?t=1753931975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the hidden levels, eerie scenes unveil the secrets of the laboratory. &quot;Here, fairness is the greatest lie, and survival is the only rule.&quot; Join &quot;The Joker's Game&quot; now to uncover the truth or become a sacrifice to the conspiracy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983660/extras/7d5abbfae65d8c4469e54b1413e948eb.avif?t=1753931975\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p>",
